SUMMARY:LGBTQ History Trivia Night
DESCRIPTION:Join us for LGBTQ+ History Trivia Night and celebrate the peo
 ple\, movements\, and moments that have shaped queer communities across g
 enerations. Test your knowledge\, learn fascinating stories\, and discove
 r how creativity\, resilience\, and a little bit of audacity have helped 
 pave the way toward liberation. No expertise required—just bring your c
 uriosity and community spirit!All Indiana University events\, groups\, ac
 tivities\, educational\, cultural\, and historical observances welcome al
 l members of the Indiana University community.
