SUMMARY:LGBTQ+ Career Support
DESCRIPTION:Have personalized support to explore your goals\, build your 
 confidence\, and take the next step in your career journey. A career cons
 ultant will be available to meet with students and address unique needs.E
 xplore Your PathClarify your goals and discover career options that fit y
 ou      Make An ImpactPolish your resume\, cover letters\, and applicatio
 n materials      Build ConfidencePractice interviewing\, networking\, and
  advocating      Affirming SupportReceive personalized guidance in a safe
  and support space      And more!Finding resources\, investigating workpl
 ace culture\, legal protections\, etc.        Appointments available for 
 individuals and small groups.
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<p>  Have personalized support to explore yo
 ur goals\, build your confidence\, and take the next step in your career 
 journey. A career consultant will be available to meet with students and 
 address unique needs.</p><ul><li><strong>Explore Your Path</strong><ul><l
 i>Clarify your goals and discover career options that fit you      </li><
 /ul></li><li><strong>Make An Impact</strong><ul><li>Polish your resume\, 
 cover letters\, and application materials      </li></ul></li><li><strong
 >Build Confidence</strong><ul><li>Practice interviewing\, networking\, an
 d advocating      </li></ul></li><li><strong>Affirming Support</strong><u
 l><li>Receive personalized guidance in a safe and support space      </li
 ></ul></li><li><strong>And more!</strong><ul><li>Finding resources\, inve
 stigating workplace culture\, legal protections\, etc.      </li></ul></l
 i></ul><p>  Appointments available for individuals and small groups.</p>
