SUMMARY:World AIDS Day
DESCRIPTION:Come together with us for an evening of remembrance\, reflect
 ion\, and hope. As we honor the many lives lost to HIV/AIDS and recognize
  the experiences of those living with HIV today\, we'll create space for 
 learning\, storytelling\, and community connection. Together\, we celebra
 te resilience\, remember our history\, and recommit ourselves to a future
  free from stigma and discrimination.All Indiana University events\, grou
 ps\, activities\, educational\, cultural\, and historical observances wel
 come all members of the Indiana University community.
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<div>  Come together with us for an evening 
 of remembrance\, reflection\, and hope. As we honor the many lives lost t
 o HIV/AIDS and recognize the experiences of those living with HIV today\,
  we'll create space for learning\, storytelling\, and community connectio
 n. Together\, we celebrate resilience\, remember our history\, and recomm
 it ourselves to a future free from stigma and discrimination.</div><div><
 /div><div><strong>All Indiana University events\, groups\, activities\, e
 ducational\, cultural\, and historical observances welcome all members of
  the Indiana University community.</strong></div>
UID:20261201T223000Z-2341890@events.iu.edu
